%description:
Tests that initialWindow = "rfc6928" resets the initial window to one segment
after two lost SYNs (RFC 6928 section 2). The tester drops the first two SYNs,
and after the handshake the client sends one segment before the first ACK
arrives.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.cli_app.sendScript="4.0 20000"
*.cli_tcp.initialWindow = "rfc6928"
*.tcptester.script="a1 delete; a2 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[9.005 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1025(1024) ack 2250501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[9.207 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1025 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
